'''applanate''' (ap′la̤-nāt), ''a.'' [< NL. ''applanatus'', < L. ''ad'', to, + ''planus'', flat, LL. ''planare'', flatten.] In ''bot.'', flattened out or horizontally expanded.
[[FIGURE]]
